STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT 1-bit strike rasterized from ChicagoFLF.ttf (Robin Casady, public domain) at
COMMENT 12px, coverage threshold 128/255. Faithful Chicago letterforms (pointed V, clean E)
COMMENT the ChiKareGo2 homage lacked; drawn for the classic Mac SYSTEM font at its native 12px.
FONT -misc-ChicagoFLF-Medium-R-Normal--12-120-75-75-P-70-MacRoman-0
SIZE 12 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 16 16 0 -4
STARTPROPERTIES 3
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 4
PIXEL_SIZE 12
ENDPROPERTIES
